  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "HSqc5H8eZJNjarL9VIP-z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 618.962870372583,
      "y": 95.88742542345062,
      "width": 725.5936940250824,
      "height": 1850,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1106172592,
      "version": 5067,
      "versionNonce": 1426618610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764491078239,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User should be able to register into our application\n- List down all the nearby restaurants based on user location\n- User should able to search hotels based on title and menu\n- Shows all the menu in the display of the restaurants\n- User should able to select various items) in the cart and make the\npayment to confirm order from nearest restaurant\n- Once the restaurant accept, find nearby delivery partner based on\ndriver location, optimised delivery time\n- Once the delivery partner pickup the order, give almost real time\nlocation of delivery partner to user\n- User should get notification on all stages and get past orders in the\nprofile\n\n\n2) Non Functional Requirements:  \n- Scalability: 50M users and 1M restaurants    \n- Performance: Low latency interms of searching for restaurants, menu\nitems, Delivery partner location \n- Availability: In terms of the restaurant searches & menu items display \n- Reliability: \n- Consistency: In terms of payment processing, order and assigning a\ndelivery partner \n- Security: Something that could be discussed is for agent-User\ncommunication their personal details like mobile number can be masked. \n\n3) Core Entities \n- User \n- Restaurant \n- Menu \n- Delivery Agent \n- Order \n- Location \n- Cart \n- Payment \n\n\n4) API Design \n\nPOST/user/register \n    Input: {User Metadata}\n    Output: 2xx, \n\nGET/restaurant/nearby?lat={lat}&long={long} : Pagination \n    Output: 2xx, {restaurant[]}\n\nGET/restaurant/search?title={title}&menuItem={menuItem} : Pagination \n    header: JWT | session Token => gives userId \n    Output: 2xx,{restaurant[]}\n\nGET/restaurant/{:restId}/menu\n    Output: 2xx, {menuitem[]}\n\nPOST/cart/item \n    Input: {restaurantId, {menuItem, quantity}[]}\n    Output:2xx, cartId \n\nPOST/order\n    Input: {orderId}\n    outPut: 2xx \n\n(Internal call to the payment gateway from the above API call)\nPOST/payment\n    Input: {orderId, paymentMetadata}\n    Output: 2xx, {paymentId}\n\n-- for restaurant finding the delivery partner nearby is all internal API\ncalls hence not keeping that here. \n\nGET/delivery/{:orderId}/tracking\n    Output: 2xx, {Metadata about order & delivery agent}\n\n    \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User should be able to register into our application\n- List down all the nearby restaurants based on user location\n- User should able to search hotels based on title and menu\n- Shows all the menu in the display of the restaurants\n- User should able to select various items) in the cart and make the payment to confirm order from nearest restaurant\n- Once the restaurant accept, find nearby delivery partner based on driver location, optimised delivery time\n- Once the delivery partner pickup the order, give almost real time location of delivery partner to user\n- User should get notification on all stages and get past orders in the profile\n\n\n2) Non Functional Requirements:  \n- Scalability: 50M users and 1M restaurants    \n- Performance: Low latency interms of searching for restaurants, menu items, Delivery partner location \n- Availability: In terms of the restaurant searches & menu items display \n- Reliability: \n- Consistency: In terms of payment processing, order and assigning a delivery partner \n- Security: Something that could be discussed is for agent-User communication their personal details like mobile number can be masked. \n\n3) Core Entities \n- User \n- Restaurant \n- Menu \n- Delivery Agent \n- Order \n- Location \n- Cart \n- Payment \n\n\n4) API Design \n\nPOST/user/register \n    Input: {User Metadata}\n    Output: 2xx, \n\nGET/restaurant/nearby?lat={lat}&long={long} : Pagination \n    Output: 2xx, {restaurant[]}\n\nGET/restaurant/search?title={title}&menuItem={menuItem} : Pagination \n    header: JWT | session Token => gives userId \n    Output: 2xx,{restaurant[]}\n\nGET/restaurant/{:restId}/menu\n    Output: 2xx, {menuitem[]}\n\nPOST/cart/item \n    Input: {restaurantId, {menuItem, quantity}[]}\n    Output:2xx, cartId \n\nPOST/order\n    Input: {orderId}\n    outPut: 2xx \n\n(Internal call to the payment gateway from the above API call)\nPOST/payment\n    Input: {orderId, paymentMetadata}\n    Output: 2xx, {paymentId}\n\n-- for restaurant finding the delivery partner nearby is all internal API calls hence not keeping that here. \n\nGET/delivery/{:orderId}/tracking\n    Output: 2xx, {Metadata about order & delivery agent}\n\n    \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
